WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.686
Metacognition helps people observe, evaluate, and improve their own thinking.

00:00:03.686 --> 00:00:06.913
It includes awareness of understanding, strategy, assumptions, confidence, errors,

00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:07.630
and feedback.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:11.932
It is useful because many learning and performance problems are not caused

00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:13.725
by lack of effort alone.

00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:18.028
They happen because people do not notice when their current method, model,

00:00:18.028 --> 00:00:21.255
or confidence is no longer aligned with the task.

00:00:21.255 --> 00:00:24.482
Strong metacognitive practice includes planning, monitoring, reflection, calibration, feedback,

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:25.558
and strategy adjustment.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.426
Planning helps choose an approach before work begins.

00:00:28.426 --> 00:00:32.012
Monitoring catches confusion and uncertainty while work is in progress.

00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:34.163
Reflection turns experience into reusable learning.

00:00:34.163 --> 00:00:36.314
Calibration keeps confidence connected to evidence.

00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:40.617
Strategy adjustment changes the method when the current method is not working.

00:00:40.617 --> 00:00:43.844
The goal is not endless introspection or harsh self-criticism.

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:47.071
The goal is better learning, better judgment, clearer decisions,

00:00:47.071 --> 00:00:49.581
and more reliable performance under real conditions.

00:00:49.581 --> 00:00:54.242
Metacognition gives people practical checkpoints: what do I know, what am I assuming,

00:00:54.242 --> 00:00:57.828
how confident should I be, what feedback do I have,

00:00:57.828 --> 00:00:59.979
and what should I change next?

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:02.489
Used well, metacognition makes people more adaptable.

00:01:02.489 --> 00:01:04.999
It helps learners avoid passive content consumption,

00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:08.226
helps professionals catch weak assumptions, helps teams communicate uncertainty,

00:01:08.226 --> 00:01:11.812
and helps AI users separate polished output from verified understanding.

00:01:11.812 --> 00:01:13.605
It is a quiet skill,

00:01:13.605 --> 00:01:17.907
but it changes the quality of the work because it improves the

00:01:17.907 --> 00:01:19.700
thinking that produces the work.
